   "source": [
    "# 🏗️ Structure Reader\n",
    "### AI Estimation Agent — Nagaland PWD SOR 2021\n",
    "\n",
    "Reads your structure details from:\n",
    "- **DXF / DWG** — AutoCAD files\n",
    "- **Image / PDF** — Scanned drawings or PDF plans  \n",
    "- **Text** — Typed description\n",
    "\n",
    "Outputs a `structure_model.json` → feeds into BOQ Generator → SOR Agent → Abstract of Cost\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "**Run cells in order ↓**"
   ]
  },
